dlmalloc: use the pages between __heap_base and the heap end again
(homescoop#1287). wasix-libc commented try_init_allocator out with its
dynamic-linking work (bbb578df62), so a larger --initial-memory never saved a
memory.grow. Back under the lock, as upstream wasi-libc. For PIE mains
__heap_end is a weak GOT.mem import; without it the end is memory.size at the
first malloc (the loader grows memory only for later dlopens).

